id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= '2018-01-01'\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < '2019-01-01'\n  GROUP BY 1, 2\n)\nSELECT m.month::date AS month,\n       ROUND(SUM(monthly.gmv) FILTER (WHERE monthly.cohort = 'NEW'), 2) AS new_customer_gmv,\n       ROUND(SUM(monthly.gmv) FILTER (WHERE monthly.cohort = 'RETURNING'), 2) AS returning_customer_gmv\nFROM generate_series('2018-01-01'::timestamp, '2018-12-01'::timestamp, INTERVAL '1 month') AS m(month)\nLEFT JOIN monthly ON monthly.month = m.month\nGROUP BY m.month\nORDER BY m.month\nLIMIT 12;\n\nNeed check PostgreSQL syntax FILTER with SUM is okay. `SUM(monthly.gmv) FILTER (WHERE ...)` yes. Need `generate_series` alias column named month? `AS m(month)` works. `m.month` timestamp. `monthly.month` timestamp. Good.\n\nPotential issue: `SUM(monthly.gmv) FILTER` after left join: For months with no matching monthly, SUM(NULL) FILTER returns NULL. Good. If month has both cohorts, each monthly row gmv. Sum filter. Good. If monthly has one row for new, one for returning. If cohort null row, ignored. Good.\n\nNeed maybe use `first_order_month` from all history. Good.\n\nNeed ensure not include canceled/unavailable in first_orders. Yes.\n\nPotential question nuance: \"有效订单含运费GMV两位\" maybe wants GMV per order? no. \"逐自然月输出有效订单含运费GMV两位，按自然人全部历史首次有效下单月区分新老客；输出月份、新客GMV、老客GMV全部12个月，缺金额事实为NULL。\" We did.\n\nNeed no explanation. Final SQL only."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":4838,"completion_tokens":3002,"total_tokens":7840,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2542},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":3046},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}